Cell["\<\
The fugacity a is that of the additional su(2) flavor symmetry. The ring is \
S_0/I_0, where the ideal I_0 is generated by the fifty-nine minimal \
generators listed in the file N4SU3.m attached to the paper.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"26c338b2-bb28-4180-bcce-f667964ab105"],

